[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731126511","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104290#issuecomment-2731126511","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104290","id":2731126511,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iya7v","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T22:50:01Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T22:50:01Z","body":"CC @lawnjelly @rburing ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731126511/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731820795","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104290#issuecomment-2731820795","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104290","id":2731820795,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i1Eb7","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T06:27:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T07:39:04Z","body":"MRPs should be in gdscript rather than C# unless they are C# specific - I can't run your MRP.\n\nBut it's likely you just need to call `reset_physics_interpolation()` on the gridmap.\n\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/physics/interpolation/using_physics_interpolation.html#call-reset-physics-interpolation-when-teleporting-objects\n\nYou need to call this on teleporting, but in your particular case of GridMap you may also need to call it after editing the gridmap to ensure the xforms are up to date in the server, I can't tell which is your problem as I say I can't run the MRP.\n\nUPDATE:\nActually on looking I hadn't changed anything in gridmap for FTI (I was getting confused with tilemap), and it can use multimesh under the hood so there may be some small fixes to do in terms of responding to `NOTIFICATION_RESET_PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION` or setting these to be non-interpolated in the server.\n\nUPDATE2:\nAs the multimeshes are not handled specially in gridmap, they look like they default to non-interpolated in the server, so there may be no problem there.\n\nSo likely the problem you are seeing are regular instances in gridmap, these should work fine as is after #104269 (as there is no longer interpolation in the server).\n\nBut yes if you can create MRP in gdscript that would be super helpful so I can check this is fixed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731820795/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734058154","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104290#issuecomment-2734058154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104290","id":2734058154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i9mqq","user":{"login":"aldocd4","id":2823944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MjM5NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2823944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4","html_url":"https://github.com/aldocd4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T17:06:47Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T17:06:47Z","body":"Sorry for the delay. Here is the GDScript version:\n\n[DebugGridMapGD.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19323915/DebugGridMapGD.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734058154/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734124357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104290#issuecomment-2734124357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104290","id":2734124357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i921F","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T17:26:13Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T17:26:13Z","body":"Yes, I can confirm this is fixed by #104269 .","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734124357/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734139641","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104290#issuecomment-2734139641","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104290","id":2734139641,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i96j5","user":{"login":"aldocd4","id":2823944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MjM5NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2823944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4","html_url":"https://github.com/aldocd4","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aldocd4/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T17:31:20Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T17:31:20Z","body":"Do you know a way to fix it on my side before 4.5 is out? I tried turning off physics interpolation for the grid but it doesn't seems to fix it. I also tried the `reset_physics_interpolation` call but I have the same issue.\n\nOr maybe I need to completely disable 3D interpolation on 4.4 for this exact scenario and wait for 4.5 before re-enabling it?\n\nThanks","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734139641/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734285875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104290#issuecomment-2734285875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104290","id":2734285875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i-eQz","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T18:10:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T18:12:42Z","body":"> Do you know a way to fix it on my side before 4.5 is out? I tried turning off physics interpolation for the grid but it doesn't seems to fix it. I also tried the reset_physics_interpolation call but I have the same issue.\n\n> Or maybe I need to completely disable 3D interpolation on 4.4 for this exact scenario and wait for 4.5 before re-enabling it?\n\nI'm not super familiar with `GridMap` and especially in 4.x. I had a little look and tried a few things like visibility and translate but  no joy so far. It is possible there's something that would do the trick but I haven't time to look this evening.\n\nI don't know the 4.4 release schedule but I would push for the new 3D FTI to be included asap as there's no point to continue working on the broken server-based version (imo), and it fixes a large number of bugs / design flaws. It's possible it will be in 4.4.1 or 4.4.2, that depends on reviewers and production team.\n\nUntil then I would disable it and be patient (or test it on other parts of your game / app). To some extent physics interpolation is experimental as it hasn't had a lot of testing in the wild, so it shouldn't be expected to be \"production ready\" from day 1, especially the more esoteric cases like this.\n\nThe other option is for you to simply download the artifact build for #104269 and work with that in the meantime.\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/workflow/testing_pull_requests.html","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2734285875/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]